 to think  of different delicious things to put in  them I was like oh my gosh Buffalo  cauliflower in a taco would be  incredible you really can't go wrong  with any of these tacos as I was making  them I was like oh the Buffalo  cauliflower is my favorite know the  mushroom wants my favorite like they're  also so good  [Music]  the breading the crisps penis also takes  a little bit of time but it's so so  worth it highly recommend so the tempeh  tacos was I remember when I pitched the  idea to my boss and she was like what  the hell is tempeh like tempeh is  something that people don't know about  but they made in their lives so a tempeh  is a fermented soybean and it's a lot  like tofu but it has more of like a more  dense almost like nutty flavor but when  you pulse it up in a food processor and  you season the heck out of it it tastes  amazing it's another thing that  replicates ground beef and I think  everyone needs tempeh in their life not  only because it has probiotics and it  has tons of protein and tons of fiber  but because it tastes absolutely  delicious and if you don't like tofu I  think you should give this a shot  because it's a lot more like dense you  really can't go wrong with making any of  these tacos they're all amazing and I  think you just have a ton of people over  and have a giant taco party and go  bananas
 

